================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY DATA NOTICES
================================================================================

This project re-distributes data prepared from open-data sources. Each source
retains its own license:

* Travel Taipei Open API (Taipei City Government, Department of Information
  and Tourism) — open government data, free re-use with attribution.
  https://www.travel.taipei/open-api/

* Taipei City Government legal hotel registry (臺北市觀光署旅宿登記) — open
  government data, free re-use with attribution.

* Taipei Metro station coordinates — open government data, free re-use with
  attribution.

* OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors) — Open Data Commons Open
  Database License (ODbL). https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

* Wikidata — Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication.

* Open-Meteo weather data — CC BY 4.0. https://open-meteo.com/

Attribution is rendered in-app and in README.md. Downstream users must
preserve attribution when redistributing the dataset files in this repo.
